# The split sum BRDF table.
#
# This file carries no data on purpose. The table depends on no environment, no
# material, and no scene, so there is nothing to author. It is the same numbers
# in every project that uses this renderer.
#
# The file exists so that the table has a path, an identity from the sidecar
# beside it, a manifest entry, and hot reload, the same as every other asset.
# Change the size or the ray budget in ibl.brdf.meta and cook again.
#
# See DESIGN.md section 9, and tools/cooker/brdf.cpp for the integration.
